  "branch": "claude/l2h-rp4a-1019",
  "tag": "rp4ahn_w562_standin",
  "purpose": "DIAGNOSTIC (x store = stand-in; never submit): HBM SM attention tile rp4a (n half, frame 561.6 x 1425.6) as two hardened halves from the L2H-SM9 rp4 halves; geometry / clock / congestion evidence for the 475.2+ SM frame re-plan (H.STA.BLK.9.1) and the rp4a parent (H.STA.BLK.14.6).",
  "structural_change": "rp4h halves (L2H-SM9) with the attention leaf (ot_hbm_sm_attn_leafh native column inlined: x store, block-dot, 2 tcl_gu, tct, PV merge s3 SAFE2 hard; sync glue resets; static attn straps registered); leaf stack forced by the closed children's pin faces (PVM R0 bottom, tct R0, tcl/bdc, xs MX, all on 43.2); regional k-means clock roots K=32 (clock_split_km.tcl, clk on the W face at half height); GN/GS kept gather relays (+3 uniform on gout, priced) and XB beat-crossing relay keep every hop <= ~375 um; io_hold_margin 0.03.",
  "extra_paths": [
   "tools/hbm_sm_repack_1015",
   "rtl/hbm_accel/sm/repack/h2",
   "rtl/hbm_accel/sm/repack/h2a",
